  "description": "Reid Hercules | Fat Bike\nBuilt for riders who want to explore beyond the beaten track, the Reid Bikes Hercules is our entry-level fat bike, combining a high-end hydroformed frame with 1×9 gearing and durable components. It's designed to take on everything from beach cruises to snowy trails and rugged off-road adventures.\nThe 4.5\" fat bike tyres can be ridden at pressures as low as 15 psi, helping the bike float across soft and loose surfaces such as sand, snow and mud. Lower tyre pressures provide extra grip and stability, making the Reid Bikes Hercules fat bike ready for terrain that regular bikes struggle to handle.\nWhether you're cruising along the beach, sliding through snow or heading off on your next adventure, the Hercules is built to keep things fun. Its strong and stable alloy frame is designed to handle rough terrain with confidence and take you down paths previously considered unrideable.\nWho is the Reid Bikes Hercules for?\nThe Hercules Fat Bike is ideal for:\n\nRiders looking to explore varied and challenging terrain\nCyclists wanting to ride on sand, snow, mud and loose surfaces\nRiders looking for the extra grip and flotation of 4.5\" fat bike tyres\nAdventurers who enjoy beach rides and off-road trails\nRiders who want the versatility of 1×9 gearing\nCyclists looking for a strong and stable alloy fat bike\nRiders who want to explore beyond where regular bikes can go\nAnyone looking for a fun and capable entry-level fat bike",
